sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis — MorphoEval overall 90.7/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py` (90.9/100, up from 59.3/100 in Pass 1; +31.6 overall). The remediated script integrates the cell-autonomous fgf8 mRNA advection-decay PDE dm/dt + v_g dm/dx = -k_d m (achieving 0.086% L2 error against m_0 exp(-k_d x / v_g) with characteristic length lambda_m = 360.67 um and determination front x* = 696.47 um), reproduces all 5 Dubrulle et al. (2001, 2004) experimental regimes (wild-type S_0 = 150.0 um, ectopic FGF8 bead compressed anterior somite S_ant = 97.5 um and catch-up posterior somite S_post = 202.5 um satisfying S_ant + S_post = 300.0 um = 2*S_0, SU5402 FGFR1 inhibition S = 215.0 um, and pCAGGS-FGF8 electroporation S = 82.5 um; Pearson r = 0.9998, RMSE = 1.13 um), includes a k_d = 0 no-decay negative control (0 somites), and segments the vendored chick/vertebrate SEM specimen (`chick_somite_psm_specimen.jpg`, 8 upper and 9 lower somites, mean spacing 48.47 px), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean`. Overall 90.7/100 (faithfulness 90.3, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 87, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis_comparison.png: rendered output of 2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1318157 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 56ac2304ddaf5a5712326eb19bafbe9c34cd7bc819580c44dcae1df7d5088234 (sha256 56ac2304ddaf5a5712326eb19bafbe9c34cd7bc819580c44dcae1df7d5088234), spec_fingerprint 5358f6fac89be6e91719f6dec1d96fe25095ac5d5f268b2b982c2f173b109336. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 5358f6fac89be6e91719f6dec1d96fe25095ac5d5f268b2b982c2f173b109336; artifact_sha256: 56ac2304ddaf5a5712326eb19bafbe9c34cd7bc819580c44dcae1df7d5088234; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis/chick_somite_psm_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2..., datasets/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis_reference.json=93e00c49c65550f9..., datasets/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis/scout_manifest.json=a38a686592f1ffd0...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427:419-422 cell-autonomous fgf8 mRNA decay gradient m(x) = m_0 exp(-k_d x / v_g) generated by tailbud-restricted transcription and axis elongation | Dubrulle, McGrew & Pourquie (2001) Cell 106:219-232 determination front threshold positioning x* = (v_g/k_d) ln(m_0/m_crit) and ectopic FGF8 bead / SU5402 somite size perturbations; reconstructed_in_script: Characteristic-upwind 1D advection-decay PDE solver dm/dt + v_g dm/dx = -k_d m (L2 relative error 0.00086 vs analytical exponential) | Lab-frame FGF8 wavefront-gated somite boundary simulator across wild-type, ectopic FGF8 bead (S_ant=97.5 um, S_post=202.5 um), SU5402 (S=215.0 um), and k_d=0 ablation control (N=0 somites) | Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on chick_somite_psm_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605); transfer_boundary: 1D anteroposterior chick presomitic mesoderm axis mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite rows; does_not_claim: Full mutual CYP26/RALDH2 retinoic acid vs FGF8 Goldbeter-Koshland bistable switch ODEs or 3D somite epithelialization mechanics." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 1D posterior FGF8 decay gradient to an anterior Retinoic Acid (RALDH2/CYP26) mutually inhibitory bistable switch (Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie 2007).",
            "remediation needed: Extend the 1D PSM axis to a 2D cell-based paraxial mesoderm strip with explicit cell-autonomous fgf8 mRNA dilution during tailbud cell division." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.907"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

